{"ID":"20240118151040-dyh4ar9","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151040-dyh4ar9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151040-dyh4ar9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151040-1xbrty2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122143103-fegf5i9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122143103-fegf5i9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:391,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:391\u0026#125;","title":"252蓼实253葱实薤白葱白254水苏","type":"doc","updated":"20240202104554"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151040-1xbrty2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151040-1xbrty2","updated":"20240122143031"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蓼实"}]},{"ID":"20240122143032-evqzgvk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143032-evqzgvk","updated":"20240122143036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，温，无毒。主明目，温中，耐风寒，下水气，面目浮肿，痈疡。马蓼，去肠中蛏虫，轻身。生川泽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143036-e2slkbu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143036-e2slkbu"}},{"ID":"20240122143037-9q2m649","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143037-9q2m649","updated":"20240122143040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"葱实"}]},{"ID":"20240122143041-7etfoc1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143041-7etfoc1","updated":"20240122143045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，温，无毒。主明目，补中不足。其茎，平，作汤，治伤寒寒热，出汗，中风，面目肿。薤，味辛，温，无毒。治金疮疮败，轻身，不饥，耐老。生平泽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143046-wehafye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143046-wehafye"}},{"ID":"20240122143047-xofsd8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143047-xofsd8w","updated":"20240122143052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"水苏"}]},{"ID":"20240122143052-46149nd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143052-46149nd","updated":"20240122143057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，微温，无毒。主下气，杀谷，除饮食，辟口臭，去毒。辟恶气。久服通神明，轻身，耐老。生池泽。一名芥蒩。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143057-6t15or1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143057-6t15or1"}},{"ID":"20240122143058-tth69xp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143058-tth69xp","updated":"20240122143103"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那后面呢，252，253，254，这个蓼实啊，葱实，水苏。水苏这种现在都已经很少使用。那像这个葱实呢，我们又有个名称叫薤白，薤白我们后面会介绍，它的味道像大蒜一样。"}]},{"ID":"20240122143103-fegf5i9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143103-fegf5i9","updated":"20240202104554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个葱实，这个相当于茎。光是一根葱，有葱尾、葱白和葱叶，那这个葱尾（根部）的部分切下来，那个尾（根部）的须须，刺激一下乳头，然后旁边这一片切下来这个切面的地方有辣味，刺激一下那个乳头，奶水就排出来了。这个葱白的地方可以入汤剂，能够通脉，通血络，活脉。葱茎呢，就是这个葱叶，葱叶这个地方，我们没有那个橡皮的导尿管，那个橡皮的导尿管是给敌人用的，因为那个很痛嘛，中医过去导尿管就是葱叶。叶子找那个比较（长，粗的），不一定是三芯葱嘛，有二芯葱也可以，叶子长这个样子，把它（的叶尖）切掉，这个头里面有津液嘛，里面辣的津液很多，（在黑板上画图）这个是葱叶，中间是空的，当把它伸到尿道里面去以后，它那个辛辣的会刺激它，一下子就排出来了。中医过去是用葱叶来导尿，哦，用途很多。这个后面的几味，蔬菜类的，谷类的，都是属于食补，真正治病的话，力量还是不够的，但是食补很重要，我们饮食上的调理非常的重要。"}]}]}